<?php $pageTitle='Privacy policy';require '../includes/header.php';?><section class="panel"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><h2>Information collected</h2><p>The system stores account name, email, optional phone and address, grievance text and location, status history, feedback, and any evidence files submitted.</p><h2>Purpose and access</h2><p>Information is used to route grievances, communicate status updates within the portal, and support authorized processing. Citizens can view their own cases; department administrators can access cases for their department; super administrators can access system records.</p><h2>Protection and retention</h2><p>Passwords are stored as hashes, database access uses prepared statements, and evidence files are stored outside the public web directory. Records remain in the local database until an administrator removes them. This project does not claim compliance with any particular law or regulatory standard.</p><h2>Corrections</h2><p>For corrections or account assistance, contact the project administrator who operates this local installation.</p></section><?php require '../includes/footer.php';?>
